Package: rsquareddata
Title: Teaching Datasets for Rsquared Academy Ebooks and Courses
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Aravind", "Hebbali", email = "hebbali.aravind@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shared teaching datasets used across Rsquared Academy ebooks,
    tutorials and courses (data wrangling, visualization, SQL): ecommerce
    sessions, messy strings, receivables, joins, high-school extracts and web
    analytics, plus Excel/Stata/SPSS/SAS import examples in `inst/extdata`.
